  "definition": "Application",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-05-26",
  "historyNote": "#7474, eff 4-5-01; amd by #9139-B, eff 4-25-08; ss by #9341, eff 12-4-08; ss by #10663, eff 9-3-14; ss by #13244, eff 7-30-21; ss by #13384, eff 5-26-22",
